 medical insights and your phone acting as a field gateway to communicate with the IoT Hub. The data we get from the phone and OBD device will be stored and analyzed using Azure services based on several inputs. This would enable meaningful insights on users driving behavior.   In case of emergency, nearby devices will be alerted immediately and a signal will be sent to our central server, which will send the location of the accident to the nearest emergency centers. This will also act as a base for smart traffic management system.","topics":[],"score":157639,"global_rank":456664},{"name":"mbmcc/PPP","owner":"mbmcc","html_url":"https://github.com/mbmcc/PPP","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":157639,"global_rank":456665},{"name":"vritant24/ProsePro","owner":"vritant24","html_url":"https://github.com/vritant24/ProsePro","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"A Word Processor for Professional and Hobbyist writer, with inbuilt version control functionality","topics":[],"score":157639,"global_rank":456666},{"name":"DarkFlamex1/RoomPluginAPI","owner":"DarkFlamex1","html_url":"https://github.com/DarkFlamex1/RoomPluginAPI","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Unity Project for the Room Plugin containing API and Examples","topics":[],"score":157639,"global_rank":456667},{"name":"mandersen/FetchOffsetCase","owner":"mandersen","html_url":"https://github.com/mandersen/FetchOffsetCase","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Example of NSFetchRequest setFetchOffset in NSFetchedResultsController","topics":[],"score":157633,"global_rank":456668},{"name":"schneiderik/uf-no","owner":"schneiderik","html_url":"https://github.com/schneiderik/uf-no","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"UF-No! The town is being invaded by UFOs, and they're abducting townspeople! It'